<title>HUNGARY: Hungary three-mth T-bill yield steady at 19.51 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary three-mth T-bill yield steady at 19.51 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's three-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 19.51 percent, unchanged from an auction held one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     17,100.43 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    19.51 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     95.3615 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
